Package: osslscope
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libcap2-bin
Maintainer: osslscope project <osslscope@localhost>
Description: Non-interposing OpenSSL observer on eBPF uprobes
 Prove which OpenSSL crypto implementations actually execute in a
 running Linux application, without changing the application.
 .
 The postinst grants CAP_BPF+CAP_PERFMON file capabilities so that
 doctor, inspect, report, and check run unprivileged.
